#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:363
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Since the Linux binary compatibility layer has gained support for running "
"both 32- and 64-bit Linux binaries, it is no longer possible to link the "
"emulation functionality statically into a custom kernel."
msgstr "由于 Linux 二进制兼容层已支持运行 32 位和 64 位 Linux 二进制文件，因此无法再将仿真功能静态链接到自定义内核中。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:365
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installing Additional Libraries Manually"
msgstr "手动安装额外的库"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:370
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For base system subdirectories created with man:debootstrap[8], use the "
"instructions above instead."
msgstr "对于使用 man:debootstrap[8] 创建的基础系统子目录，请改用上述说明。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:373
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If a Linux application complains about missing shared libraries after "
"configuring Linux binary compatibility, determine which shared libraries the "
"Linux binary needs and install them manually."
msgstr "配置 Linux 二进制兼容性后，如果 Linux 应用程序提示缺少共享库，请确定该 Linux 二进制文件所需的共享库，并手动安装。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:375
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"From a Linux system using the same CPU architecture, `ldd` can be used to "
"determine which shared libraries the application needs."
msgstr "在使用相同 CPU 架构的 Linux 系统上，可以使用 `ldd` 确定应用程序需要哪些共享库。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:377
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For example, to check which shared libraries `linuxdoom` needs, run this "
"command from a Linux system that has Doom installed:"
msgstr "例如，要检查 `linuxdoom` 需要哪些共享库，请在安装了 Doom 的 Linux 系统上运行以下命令："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:381
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% ldd linuxdoom\n"
msgstr "% ldd linuxdoom\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:390
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"libXt.so.3 (DLL Jump 3.1) => /usr/X11/lib/libXt.so.3.1.0\n"
"libX11.so.3 (DLL Jump 3.1) => /usr/X11/lib/libX11.so.3.1.0\n"
"libc.so.4 (DLL Jump 4.5pl26) => /lib/libc.so.4.6.29\n"
msgstr "libXt.so.3 (DLL Jump 3.1) => /usr/X11/lib/libXt.so.3.1.0\nlibX11.so.3 (DLL Jump 3.1) => /usr/X11/lib/libX11.so.3.1.0\nlibc.so.4 (DLL Jump 4.5pl26) => /lib/libc.so.4.6.29\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:394
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Then, copy all the files in the last column of the output from the Linux "
"system into [.filename]#/compat/linux# on the FreeBSD system.  Once copied, "
"create symbolic links to the names in the first column."
msgstr "然后，将输出最后一列中的所有文件从 Linux 系统复制到 FreeBSD 系统上的 [.filename]#/compat/linux#。复制完成后，为第一列中的名称创建符号链接。"

#. type: Plain text
