#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:424
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "libc.so.4 (DLL Jump 4.5pl26) -> libc.so.4.6.29\n"
msgstr "libc.so.4 (DLL Jump 4.5pl26) -> libc.so.4.6.29\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:428
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Since the existing library is only one or two versions out of date in the "
"last digit, the program should still work with the slightly older version.  "
"However, it is safe to replace the existing [.filename]#libc.so# with the "
"newer version:"
msgstr ""
"由于现有的库在最后一个数字中只有一个或两个版本过时，因此程序仍然需要使用稍旧"
"的版本。但是，用更新的版本替换现有<filename>libc.so</filename>是安全的："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:433
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"/compat/linux/lib/libc.so.4.6.29\n"
"/compat/linux/lib/libc.so.4 -> libc.so.4.6.29\n"
msgstr "/compat/linux/lib/libc.so.4.6.29\n/compat/linux/lib/libc.so.4 -> libc.so.4.6.29\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:437
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Generally, one will need to look for the shared libraries that Linux "
"binaries depend on only the first few times that a Linux program is "
"installed on FreeBSD.  After a while, there will be a sufficient set of "
"Linux shared libraries on the system to be able to run newly installed Linux "
"binaries without any extra work."
msgstr "通常，只有在 FreeBSD 上首次安装 Linux 程序的前几次，才需要查找 Linux 二进制文件所依赖的共享库。过一段时间后，系统中就会有足够的 Linux 共享库，之后安装新的 Linux 二进制文件无需额外操作即可运行。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:438
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Branding Linux ELF Binaries"
msgstr "为 Linux ELF 二进制文件添加标记"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:441
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The FreeBSD kernel uses several methods to determine if the binary to be "
"executed is a Linux one: it checks the brand in the ELF file header, looks "
"for known ELF interpreter paths and checks ELF notes; finally, by default, "
"unbranded ELF executables are assumed to be Linux anyway."
msgstr "FreeBSD 内核会使用多种方法判断要执行的二进制文件是否为 Linux 二进制文件：检查 ELF 文件头中的标记，查找已知的 ELF 解释器路径，并检查 ELF 注释；最后，默认情况下，未标记的 ELF 可执行文件也会被视为 Linux 二进制文件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:443
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Should all those methods fail, an attempt to execute the binary might result "
"in error message:"
msgstr "如果上述方法都无法奏效，尝试执行该二进制文件可能会导致以下错误消息："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:447
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% ./my-linux-elf-binary\n"
msgstr "% ./my-linux-elf-binary\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:455
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"ELF binary type not known\n"
"Abort\n"
msgstr "ELF binary type not known\nAbort\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:458
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To help the FreeBSD kernel distinguish between a FreeBSD ELF binary and a "
"Linux binary, use man:brandelf[1]:"
msgstr "要帮助 FreeBSD 内核区分 FreeBSD ELF 二进制文件和 Linux 二进制文件，请使用 man:brandelf[1]："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:462
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% brandelf -t Linux my-linux-elf-binary\n"
msgstr "% brandelf -t Linux my-linux-elf-binary\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:464
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Installing a Linux RPM Based Application"
msgstr "安装基于 Linux RPM 的应用程序"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:468
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To install a Linux RPM-based application, first install the package:"
"archivers/rpm4[] package or port.  Once installed, `root` can use this "
"command to install a [.filename]#.rpm#:"
msgstr "要安装基于 Linux RPM 的应用程序，请先安装 package:archivers/rpm4[] 软件包或移植版本。安装后，`root` 可以使用以下命令安装 [.filename]#.rpm# 文件："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:473
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# cd /compat/linux\n"
"# rpm2cpio < /path/to/linux.archive.rpm | cpio -id\n"
msgstr "# cd /compat/linux\n# rpm2cpio < /path/to/linux.archive.rpm | cpio -id\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:477
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If necessary, `brandelf` the installed ELF binaries.  Note that this will "
"prevent a clean uninstall."
msgstr "如有必要，请为已安装的 ELF 二进制文件运行 `brandelf`。请注意，这会导致无法彻底卸载。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:478
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuring the Hostname Resolver"
msgstr "配置主机名解析器"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:481
#, fuzzy
msgid "If DNS does not work or this error appears:"
msgstr "如果 DNS 无法正常工作，或者出现以下错误："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:486
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"resolv+: \"bind\" is an invalid keyword resolv+:\n"
"\"hosts\" is an invalid keyword\n"
msgstr ""
"resolv+: \"bind\" is an invalid keyword resolv+:\n"
"\"hosts\" is an invalid keyword\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:489
#, fuzzy
msgid "configure [.filename]#/compat/linux/etc/host.conf# as follows:"
msgstr "按如下方式配置 [.filename]#/compat/linux/etc/host.conf#："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:494
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"order hosts, bind\n"
"multi on\n"
msgstr ""
"order hosts, bind\n"
"multi on\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/linuxemu/_index.adoc:499
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This specifies that [.filename]#/etc/hosts# is searched first and DNS is "
"searched second.  When [.filename]#/compat/linux/etc/host.conf# does not "
"exist, Linux applications use [.filename]#/etc/host.conf# in the host system "
"but they complain since that file does not exist in FreeBSD.  Remove `bind` "
"if a name server is not configured using [.filename]#/etc/resolv.conf#."
msgstr "这会指定先搜索 [.filename]#/etc/hosts#，再搜索 DNS。如果 [.filename]#/compat/linux/etc/host.conf# 不存在，Linux 应用程序会使用主机系统的 [.filename]#/etc/host.conf#，但会因该文件在 FreeBSD 中不存在而发出警告。如果未通过 [.filename]#/etc/resolv.conf# 配置名称服务器，请删除 `bind`。"

